| Handler | XML parser | DTD disabled | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| `AbstractVelbusProtocol` | `DocumentBuilderFactory` | ✅ 5 features set | Patched (CVE-2026-40882) |
| `KNXProtocol` | `Saxon` + `XMLInputFactory` | ❌ none set | **Not patched** |


